WEBVTT

00:02:59.926 --> 00:03:03.095
and it appears that our
bodies have limits.

00:03:03.137 --> 00:03:06.724
If we exercise harder,
at first we may expend more energy,

00:03:06.766 --> 00:03:07.934
but over time,

00:03:07.975 --> 00:03:10.728
our metabolism will find ways to conserve.

00:03:10.728 --> 00:03:12.063
Here's what I'm getting at.

00:03:12.104 --> 00:03:15.566
The point of our metabolic system
is to manage energy,

00:03:15.608 --> 00:03:17.151
not to manage weight.

00:03:17.193 --> 00:03:19.445
So if you read an article

00:03:19.487 --> 00:03:24.492
or hear a so-called expert inviting you
to boost your metabolism,

00:03:24.533 --> 00:03:28.829
remember that’s just marketing speak
rooted in a weight loss culture.

00:03:28.871 --> 00:03:30.623
And it just isn’t true.